  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Floating LNG Storage and Regasification Unit, through Global Marketing &amp; Communications, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $295,000 Ghana Floating Liquefied Natural Gas Storage and Regasification Unit (FSRU) Reverse Trade Mission provided an environment for Ghana&apos;s FSRU stakeholders to (1) deepen their understanding of FSRU technologies and project implementation; (2) identify potential safety and security procedures and technologies to ensure the safe deployment and operation of the FSRU; and (3) meet U.S. technical experts that could help the Ghanaians assess the optimal positioning and offshore location of the proposed FSRU.</narrative>
  </description>
